\newlabel{fig:bench_Tf_overlay}{{8.2}{204}{Fuel temperature $T_f$ overlay. Run~1 (blue) begins a smooth decay near $t = 2{,}500$\,s, reaching the zero clamp by $t \approx 5{,}000$\,s. Run~2 (red) maintains stable periodic operation}{figure.8.2}{}}
