\newlabel{fig:bench_Tf_diff}{{8.5}{206}{Fuel temperature difference (Run~1 $-$ Run~2). The smooth onset near $t = 2{,}000$\,s saturates at approximately $-0.72$. The difference statistics are $|\max | = 7.54 \times 10^{-1}$, $\mu = -4.68 \times 10^{-1}$, $\sigma = 3.21 \times 10^{-1}$}{figure.8.5}{}}
